            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-heading text-[20px] md:text-[24px] text-[#0F1422] leading-snug mb-3">Reflection That Lands in Action</h4>
            <p class="font-body text-[15px] md:text-base text-[#1A1F2E]/72 leading-relaxed">
              Emotional reflection matters, and so does what comes from it. Insight gradually becomes embodied through action, communication, self-observation, and lived change.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-heading text-[20px] md:text-[24px] text-[#0F1422] leading-snug mb-3">Contemplative Practice as a Practical Tool</h4>
            <p class="font-body text-[15px] md:text-base text-[#1A1F2E]/72 leading-relaxed">
              Meditation and breathwork serve attention, nervous system regulation, and self-observation. The work stays anchored in real life: relationships, study, work, health, and honest engagement with reality.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-4 font-body text-base text-[#1A1F2E]/75 leading-relaxed">
        <p>Most young men want to become more themselves, not somebody else:
